    Bug 946643 - Improve status bar and error messages for newsgroups.r=mkmelin


    - Add a status bar message for downloading headers. (Downloading and processing a large XOVER response blocks the entire UI for some time.)
    - Include the newsgroup name in status bar messages about no new message headers.
    - When downloading newsgroup articles for offline use, display only one status bar message. Also report when there are no articles to download for a group.
    - Also include the account name in alerts such as posting errors.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D246092

